{
  "id": "bulk-cards-local",
  "title": "bulkCards suspend, unsuspend, bury, unbury and flag by card_ids and by query, dry_run, skipped ids, and what is refused (SHELL.md 4.3)",
  "covers": [
    "cards.bulk_local_actions",
    "cards.bulk_dry_run",
    "cards.bulk_skipped_ids",
    "cards.bulk_validation"
  ],
  "narrative": [
    "Three new cards (...10, ...20, ...30), one per note. Only the five actions SHELL.md 4.3 makes local are used; set_preset, add_tags, remove_tags, move and delete are forwarded by the shell and so are not parity-tested (section 8.2: scenarios never go online).",
    "Step 0 suspends cards 10 and 20 by card_ids: one op per card. Step 1 reads card 10 back.",
    "Step 2 is a dry run of unsuspend over all three: ops_emitted 0 and dry_run true; step 3 shows card 10 is still suspended.",
    "Step 4 unsuspends card 10 together with an id that exists nowhere: the unknown id is skipped and counted, not an error. Step 5 reads card 10 back.",
    "Step 6 flags by query is:suspended (only card 20 is suspended now); step 7 reads it. Step 8 clears the flag by query flag:3 (flags 0 clears); step 9 reads it.",
    "Step 10 buries card 30 without until (the default is the start of the next study day; the golden holds the instant). Step 12 buries card 10 until an explicit instant; step 13 reads it back.",
    "Step 14: card 10 and 30 are buried and card 20 is suspended, so the queue is empty. Step 15 unburies both; step 17: the queue serves cards 10 and 30 (20 stays suspended).",
    "Step 18: a query matching no card is a successful no-op.",
    "Steps 19-22 are refused with 422 validation_failed and mint nothing: flag without flags, both selectors, no selector, bury until an instant in the past. Step 23 shows card 10 untouched by them."
  ],
